  "plot_alt_text": "Two panels. Left: motional occupation versus time under three channels — heating rising from the ground state toward the bath occupation of two, amplitude damping decaying a Fock-five state toward zero, and a windowed heating run that rises then flattens when its window closes at the half-way point; the closed-form exponential laws (dashed) overlie the numerics. Right: under pure dephasing the coherence quadrature of a coherent state decays as exp of minus gamma t over two while the normalised mean occupation trace stays flat at one — phase damping without energy loss.",
